{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14223080","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14223080","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1422308001:1":{"text":"하르그, 저희가 돌아왔어요!","source_cn":"哈尔格，我们回来啦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA162A694101D7199","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1422308002:1":{"text":"프리다와 탈리는 모든 게 괜찮아 보였어요. 저희가 도망친 칠면조까지 잡아주었답니다!","source_cn":"弗瑞达和塔莉看上去一切都好，我们还帮她们赶回了跑掉的火鸡！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF854C7D4FFB61E3D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1422308003:1":{"text":"그치만 프리다는 당신을 많이 걱정하는 것 같았어요. 최근에 보낸 편지에 답장이 없다면서 저희에게 새로운 편지를 보내달라고 부탁했어요.","source_cn":"不过弗瑞达看起来很担心你的样子，她说最近寄给你的信没有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x00A9904BE14B36BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1422308004:1":{"text":"그 편지들이 도착했을 때 전 이미 집으로 돌아가는 길이었어요... 새 편지를 읽어보고 싶네요!","source_cn":"那些信到的时候，我已经在回家的路上了……我想看看那封新的信！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1BF866CF1F2EBDB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:哈尔格":{"text":"하르그","source":"哈尔格","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":3}}